# L1-OUT-003 canonical row order: four records sharing one TIME_STAMP
# (192:15:54:50.000500), supplied in an order that violates every level of the
# sort key. Expected output order is RT 3/SA 2 T, RT 3/SA 11 R, RT 3/SA 11 T,
# RT 21/SA 3 R -- proving: RT ascending; subaddress ascending NUMERICALLY within
# an RT (2 before 11, which a lexicographic MSG compare would invert); and
# receive before transmit at an equal subaddress.

